name: sim.getJointType
description: Retrieves the type of a joint
luaSynopsis: int jointType = sim.getJointType(int objectHandle)
pythonSynopsis: int jointType = sim.getJointType(int objectHandle)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the joint
outputs:
1. jointType: type of the joint:
    - sim.joint_revolute
    - sim.joint_prismatic
    - sim.joint_spherical
